      "created_at": "2026-10-13T07:39:09.000Z",
      "created_timestamp": 1791877149000,
      "text": "$BTC.D Making another push for it. No real big moves have happened on here the entire year.\n\nHonestly, with how much some alts ran up and how little people have really cared about their BTC vs Alts portfolio distribution, I don't think it would be bad BTC to take the spotlight for a bit.\n\nUpside is that it gets a lot more bid and it can rally much easier than if the majority of the market is speculating on alts.\n\nOf course, alts will still run if BTC makes new local highs, but if BTC outperforms it usually makes for the strongest and most steady rallies. The ones where you can see big percentages in a month. Then after we can continue the altcoin speculation & outperformance again (still selectively of course).",
